    "text": "I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the LandAcquisition (Amendment) Act No.28 of 1964, that theGovernment intends to acquire the following Land/Servitudewhich is required for a public purpose.",
