      515.75
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested, in the aforesaid land/lands on whicha servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appearpersonally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, beforeme at Kuliyapitiya -East Divisional Secretariat, on the day ofthe 22nd January 2020 at 10.30 a.m.",
